    <p class="sx-hero__subtitle">
      Window Film Philadelphia is an authorized Solyx installer serving Philadelphia, the Main Line, South Jersey, and surrounding suburbs. Frosted privacy, decorative pattern, gradient, solar control, and safety film — the full Solyx lineup, professionally installed.
    </p>

    <div class="sx-hero__cta">
      <a href="/contact/" class="sx-hero__btn-primary">Get Your Free Estimate</a>
      <a href="tel:2673947980" class="sx-hero__btn-secondary">
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20.01 15.38c-1.23 0-2.42-.2-3.53-.56-.35-.12-.74-.03-1.01.24l-1.57 1.97c-2.83-1.35-5.48-3.9-6.89-6.83l1.95-1.66c.27-.28.35-.67.24-1.02-.37-1.11-.56-2.3-.56-3.53 0-.54-.45-.99-.99-.99H4.19C3.65 3 3 3.24 3 3.99 3 13.28 10.73 21 20.01 21c.71 0 .99-.63.99-1.18v-3.45c0-.54-.45-.99-.99-.99z" fill="currentColor"/></svg>
        Call (267) 394-7980
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="sx-hero__stats-panel" aria-label="Key Solyx window film statistics">
      <div class="sx-hero__stats-inner">
        <CountUp end={700} suffix="+" label="Designs in the Solyx Library" />
        <div class="sx-hero__stat-divider" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <CountUp end={99} suffix="%" label="UV Block (Functional Films)" />
        <div class="sx-hero__stat-divider" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <CountUp end={8} suffix=" mil" label="Max UltraSafe Thickness" />
        <div class="sx-hero__stat-divider" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <CountUp end={15} suffix="+" label="Years Philadelphia Installs" />
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<div class="ip-page-body">

<!-- ══════════════════════════════════════
     INTRO + TRUST BAR
══════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section class="sx-intro">
  <div class="sx-intro__inner">

    <div class="sx-intro__image-col">
      <div class="sx-intro__image-wrap">
        <img
          src="/images/solyx-window-film-philadelphia-intro.jpg"
          alt="Window Film Philadelphia installer applying Solyx decorative film to a Philadelphia office glass partition"
          title="Solyx window film installation Philadelphia — authorized Solyx installer"
          width="600"
          height="720"
          loading="lazy"
          class="sx-intro__img"
        />
        <div class="sx-intro__badge">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2l2.09 6.26H21l-5.47 3.97 2.09 6.27L12 14.54l-5.62 3.96 2.09-6.27L3 8.26h6.91L12 2z" fill="#81AB4C"/></svg>
          <span>Authorized Solyx Installer</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="sx-intro__content">
      <span class="sx-intro__eyebrow">Why Solyx &amp; Window Film Philadelphia</span>
      <h2 class="sx-intro__title">Why do Philadelphia designers choose Solyx film?</h2>
      <p class="sx-intro__lead">Solyx decorative film Philadelphia properties use isn't a secondary product line — it's what Decorative Films, LLC was built to make. With over 700 designs spanning geometric, organic, frosted, gradient, and specialty categories, Solyx gives Philadelphia architects, interior designers, and property owners a level of choice that no other architectural film brand offers.</p>
      <p class="sx-intro__body">Window Film Philadelphia is an authorized Solyx installer, which means we carry the full product lineup and every installation is backed by the manufacturer's warranty. Solyx window film in Philadelphia is available from our team for residential and commercial projects of every scale — from a single bathroom window in a Queen Village rowhome to an entire suite of conference room glass partitions in a Center City tower.</p>
      <div class="sx-intro__creds">
        <div class="sx-intro__cred">
          <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" stroke="#81AB4C" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M8 12l3 3 5-5" stroke="#81AB4C" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          Authorized Solyx Installer
        </div>
        <div class="sx-intro__cred">
          <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" stroke="#81AB4C" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M8 12l3 3 5-5" stroke="#81AB4C" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          Licensed &amp; Insured
        </div>
        <div class="sx-intro__cred">
          <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" stroke="#81AB4C" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M8 12l3 3 5-5" stroke="#81AB4C" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          Serving Philadelphia Since 2008
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="sx-intro__ctas">
        <a href="/contact/" class="pp-btn pp-btn--primary">Get a Free Quote</a>
        <a href="tel:2673947980" class="pp-btn pp-btn--ghost">Call (267) 394-7980</a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<!-- ══ TRUST BAR ══ -->
<section class="sx-trust">
  <div class="sx-trust__inner">
    <p class="sx-trust__label">Philadelphia's authorized Solyx installer &mdash; stocking the full Solyx lineup</p>
    <div class="sx-trust__badges">
      <div class="sx-trust__badge">
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2l2.09 6.26H21l-5.47 3.97 2.09 6.27L12 14.54l-5.62 3.96 2.09-6.27L3 8.26h6.91L12 2z" fill="#81AB4C"/></svg>
