      <p class="sx-pl-row__body">No other architectural window film brand offers a design library this wide. The SOLYX® Geometric Collection spans clean lines, grids, diamonds, radial patterns, and faceted forms — the vocabulary of modern commercial interiors. The Organic Collection covers nature, waves, ice glass, marble, fiber, and textile patterns for hospitality, healthcare, and residential spaces that need warmth alongside privacy. Both collections are available cut-to-size and made-to-size for precise glass coverage at any dimension.</p>
