      <p class="sx-pl-row__body">For Philadelphia properties where heat gain and glare are real operational problems — not just comfort preferences — the SOLYX® UltraCool Series delivers targeted solar performance in a high-clarity format. The flagship UltraCool-IR8360 is a premium Nano Ceramic polyester film engineered for spectrally selective IR blocking. Its construction targets infrared radiation while allowing visible light to pass through, which means significant heat reduction without the dark or mirrored appearance of conventional reflective solar films.</p>
      <p class="sx-pl-row__body">The series covers a range of solar performance levels. UltraCool-Ceramic-35 provides 35% VLT with premium ceramic heat rejection. The silver-series options (S1560, S3560, S6060) range from high privacy at 15% VLT to nearly clear at 60% VLT for properties that want solar performance with minimal visual change. For outside-facing applications on certain building types, the UltraCool-S20-OSW outside-weatherable film extends the application range beyond standard interior-mounted solar film. All UltraCool films block UV radiation to protect furnishings, artwork, and flooring from fading.</p>
